        "title": "Use a Question-Driven Explanation Grammar",
        "description": "Center the graph on a Topic and Summary. Seed six qa-question instances with who, what, where, when, why, and how lenses. Connect repeatable Answer, Source, Example, Caveat, and optional Term nodes through explicit semantic edges.",
        "differentiator": "One reusable question class with a lens field remains extensible while the graph grammar distinguishes answers, support, illustration, qualification, dependency, follow-up, and synthesis.",
