      "data": {
        "title": "Separate Node Type for Every Question Word",
        "description": "Create distinct Who, What, Where, When, Why, and How node classes, or use generic markdown nodes with no explanatory grammar.",
        "tradeoffs": "Separate classes make the initial layout obvious but multiply contracts and resist custom questions. Generic markdown is flexible but loses semantic structure and inspectable relationships.",
