        "title": "The Template Could Over-Structure Simple Explanations",
        "description": "A rigid six-question layout may force irrelevant answers, encourage shallow completeness, or make a small explanation feel bureaucratic.",
        "likelihood": "medium",
        "impact": "medium",
        "mitigation": "Treat the six lenses as removable seeds, permit custom lenses, and require only questions relevant to the topic.",
